    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135517",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ESCALUS.\nEvery letter he hath writ hath disvouched other.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135517/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135517/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3845909,
        "end": 3845996,
        "line": 142249,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap21/p@135517",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_21.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ESCALUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135608",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANGELO.\nIn most uneven and distracted manner. His actions show much like to madness; pray heaven his wisdom be not tainted. And why meet him at the gates and redeliver our authorities there?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135608/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135608/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 190,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3846000,
        "end": 3846222,
        "line": 142254,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap21/p@135608",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_21.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANGELO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135834",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ESCALUS.\nI guess not.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135834/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135834/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 21,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3846226,
        "end": 3846277,
        "line": 142261,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap21/p@135834",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_21.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ESCALUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135889",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANGELO.\nAnd why should we proclaim it in an hour before his entering, that if any crave redress of injustice, they should exhibit their petitions in the street?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135889/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@135889/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 160,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3846281,
        "end": 3846472,
        "line": 142266,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap21/p@135889",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_21.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANGELO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136084",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ESCALUS.\nHe shows his reason for that: to have a dispatch of complaints, and to deliver us from devices hereafter, which shall then have no power to stand against us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136084/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136084/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 166,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3846476,
        "end": 3846672,
        "line": 142272,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap21/p@136084",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_21.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ESCALUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136284",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANGELO.\nWell, I beseech you, let it be proclaimed.\nBetimes i’ th’ morn I’ll call you at your house.\nGive notice to such men of sort and suit\nAs are to meet him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136284/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136284/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136284/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136284/line-4",
          "start": 100,
          "end": 140,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136284/line-5",
          "start": 141,
          "end": 160,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3846676,
        "end": 3846881,
        "line": 142278,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap21/p@136284",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_21.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANGELO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136493",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ESCALUS.\nI shall, sir. Fare you well.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneIV_21.4/p@136493/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
